      "writtenOn": "2025-10-23T21:12:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Sorry after second thought and looking into code it seems it can\u0027t happen since without PKVM_GHC_START_CPU triggered by protected guest the vcpu mp state will not be set to KVM_MP_STATE_RUNNABLE, therefore we cannot reach this code path.\n\nPlease ignore this comment.",
      "parentUuid": "108eb5a4_a534dc6a",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 798,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 803,
        "endChar": 0
