                "startChar": 0,
                "endLine": 10053,
                "endChar": 0
              },
              "replacement": "\t/*\n\t * For pKVM, the SIPI vector is controlled by the protected guest and\n\t * is not taken from the \u0027start_ip\u0027 provided in the hypercall.\n\t * Thus, we don\u0027t need to update apic-\u003esipi_vector here.\n\t */\n"
            }
